{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CggeVE2QgrGx57MpUaaT3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Permanganate is Mn(VII), a d⁰ tetrahedral complex. It has no d electrons, so no d–d transitions are possible.\n\nThe three bands at 17 570, 31 560 and 38 320 cm⁻¹ are intense, with ε of about 1 500–3 000. They are ligand-to-metal charge-transfer (LMCT) transitions, from O(2p) orbitals to the Mn 2e and 3t₂ orbitals. The usual assignments are:\n- t₁ → e (¹T₂ ← ¹A₁)\n- t₂ → e\n- t₁ → t₂\n\nLigand-field theory is not the right model for these bands, for two reasons:\n- Dq and B are fitted from d^n spin-allowed d–d transitions, using Tanabe–Sugano matrices. A d⁰ ion has no d–d states, so there is nothing to fit. No electron–electron repulsion within the d shell can be probed, so B and C of \"the central metal ion\" are not defined by these data.\n- The e–t₂ gap is not a pure ligand-field splitting. The bands are charge-transfer transitions, and the energy difference between them reflects ligand–metal covalency and orbital-energy differences, not 10Dq. The e–t₂ splitting is strongly covalent. Treating the band spacings as Dq would give meaningless numbers.\n\nI therefore do not report values for Dq, B or C. They cannot be determined reliably from these data within the ligand-field model.\n\n{\"Dq\": null, \"B\": null, \"C\": null, \"out_of_scope\": true, \"reason\": \"MnO4- is d0 and its intense bands are O→Mn charge-transfer transitions, so Dq, B and C cannot be obtained from d-d ligand-field analysis.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":253,"cache_read_input_tokens":1480,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":253,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2d335cc0-1005-4054-a664-90eeb55b0001","uuid":"0737896c-224e-4ea6-934d-a264d0cb99ca","timestamp":"2026-11-03T20:44:44.436Z","request_id":"req_011CggeVDgagujbuYDFBRCyh"}
